{
  "id": 105157238,
  "iid": 3428,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "IOGraph: time series plotting all instances of a field",
  "description": "Introduces a new time series mechanism for IO Graph which allows to plot all\ninstances of a field. Otherwise it would only be possible to plot fields after\nan aggregation function like SUM, MAX, MIN or others was applied to it.\n\nTime series for a field can be selected as \"DIRECT(Y Field)\" for Y Axis.\nThe new time series mechanism works independently from the existing interval\nbased mechanism to enable plotting values without aggregation function being\napplied.\n\nRelates to #17442.",
