      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 606783057,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "How is this supposed to work with Line and Impulse/Bar style?\n\nMy immediate thought is to draw line/impulse/bar between min and max within the interval, but it doesn't look like this is happening.",
          "author": {
            "id": 4753670,
            "username": "stigbjorlykke",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Stig Bjørlykke",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/905aafc6b50e246885f5ea9273a9dc4f22e2658b71f9a1b551b797082bec3f80?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/stigbjorlykke"
          },
          "created_at": "2021-06-21T15:07:12.587Z",
          "updated_at": "2021-06-21T17:00:40.907Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 105157238,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": true,
          "resolved": true,
          "resolved_by": {
            "id": 7625625,
            "username": "Developer-Alexander",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Developer Alexander",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/81b3f01484e58a678d9a77825dd6726e0e7e2383b67d9a16215a35fe0a729529?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/Developer-Alexander"
          },
          "resolved_at": "2021-08-22T07:42:17.479Z",
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 3428,
          "commands_changes": {}
        },
        {
          "id": 606892229,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I think Bar style won't work well with this feature. A Bar chart only looks nicely if you have a relatively low amount of data that equaly distributed over the available space. Thats the reason why I think Bar style isn't a good option when working with small intervals.\n\nSince this feature is about plotting a large amount of data even when its distributed densely I think you better go with Line or dot-like styles.\n\nIf your question is more about if it is possible to use the new time series feature simultaneously with interval based graphs: That should work. The following screenshot tries to illustrate:\n\n\n![2021-06-21_18_54_27-Wireshark___I_O_Graph___trace.pcap](/uploads/87f0760bce221848faded3948c877171/2021-06-21_18_54_27-Wireshark___I_O_Graph___trace.pcap.png)",
          "author": {
            "id": 7625625,
            "username": "Developer-Alexander",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Developer Alexander",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/81b3f01484e58a678d9a77825dd6726e0e7e2383b67d9a16215a35fe0a729529?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/Developer-Alexander"
          },
          "created_at": "2021-06-21T17:00:40.838Z",
          "updated_at": "2021-06-21T17:00:40.838Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 105157238,
