      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 606879932,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Sorry, I should have provided some screenshots.\n\nThe following two screenshot shows the main use case of the change. It is illustrated with an examplary field which contains the values of a sinus curve. (`trivial.sinus`)\n\n![2021-06-21_18_37_04-Wireshark___I_O_Graph___trace.pcap](/uploads/693e9b7cb730a05aa6775c826d73eeed/2021-06-21_18_37_04-Wireshark___I_O_Graph___trace.pcap.png)\n\n![2021-06-21_18_37_46-Wireshark___I_O_Graph___trace.pcap](/uploads/eb07b27ee7ab8e16a3180e10f893616a/2021-06-21_18_37_46-Wireshark___I_O_Graph___trace.pcap.png)\n\nAt least from my point of view, it's mainly intended to be used with chart styles like line or dot-like. Impulse may work well aswell.",
